  "reviewer_note": "Least sure of day-level dates: the sources conflict, so only 325 is recorded. Attendance is also disputed (about 300 bishops vs 318 vs 250 vs about 220) and is left out of the summary. The sources call the city Nicaea/Nicea/Nice; its modern name was not on an opened page, so modern_name says only modern-day Turkey. Pin is the Wikidata point for ancient Nicaea.",
